  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme Management, Strategy and Support Team (PMSST) for the Governance foundations to sustain forests and people: FGMC2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PMSST will support implementation, strategic engagement and monitoring of all aspects of the programme as well as running the FGMC Accountable Grant Scheme. The Supplier will work closely with FCDO in the management and oversight of all components and delivery partners of FGMC2, including: (i) responsibility for contracting, financial and performance oversight of a strategic Accountable Grants on behalf of FCDO; (ii) performance oversight of projects providing technical support in partner countries as indicated by the SRO; (iii) programme-wide monitoring, evaluation, and learning, and (iv) providing strategic and technical advice to FCDO and programme partners. The FGMC accountable grants scheme will operate  across partner countries in Asia, Pacific, Africa and South America.</narrative>
  </description>
